00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.710
and you end up going right
back to the same kind

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.690
of behavior or something that
will recreate that behavior.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.403
The abuse, the disrespect,

00:12:05.403 --> 00:12:07.153
the lack of love, all that stuff.

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:12.500
- By going back into it,
you're not helping yourself.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:20.193
You're just putting yourself
back into that same situation.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.160
- [Mark] What does this
kind of work taught you

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.243
about human nature or about men?

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.450
- Everybody's different.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.283
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:12:38.316 --> 00:12:39.166
That's very true.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.140
- You can't judge anybody,

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.570
because I'm the one out there, you know.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.640
I don't know what's going
on in these people's lives

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:57.197
to have them paying for females, you know.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.270
- [Mark] Do you get asked to do things

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:08.033
that you're uncomfortable to do?

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:10.800
Like, have sex without a condom.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.648
- Sometimes, but I just tell them no.

00:13:12.648 --> 00:13:13.930
- [Mark] You do?

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.323
- If I don't feel
comfortable, I'm not doing it.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.870
- [Mark] You believe in karma.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.533
- I do, good and bad.

00:13:32.878 --> 00:13:35.170
- [Mark] There's a lot of
karma stories in your life,

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.373
from what your dad did to you and

00:13:37.373 --> 00:13:40.340
- Oh, I know, and it's going to get him.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.270
- [Mark] And the decisions
you've made for yourself also

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.530
you'll pay a price for that down the road

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.340
and if you change the
direction of your life

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.813
you'll change your karma as well.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:54.210
- See, the thing is, I
have time to change mine.

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.603
- [Mark] Yeah, but don't waste it.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.270
A lot of people, you know,

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:01.370
start in their teens and
they never ever get out.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.320
I've talked to a lot of women

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.170
in their fifties and sixties, I think

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.150
and they're still doing this.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.459
- That's them, I'm me.

00:14:08.459 --> 00:14:09.709
- [Mark] Good for you.

00:14:09.709 --> 00:14:10.792
Good for you.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.910
What about your childhood do you think

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.940
if it was different, if
it had been different,

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.133
might have changed the
direction of your life?

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:21.993
Having your mom?

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.820
- Probably, yeah.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.473
- [Mark] I would think
that would be a big one.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:30.770
What have you learned
from doing this kind of,

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.173
living this kind of life?

00:14:32.173 --> 00:14:34.110
What mistakes have you said, oh my God.

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:36.353
I need to never do that again.

00:14:42.985 --> 00:14:43.818
- I don't know.

00:14:43.818 --> 00:14:45.270
You make mistakes to learn from them,

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:47.780
so I don't really repeat
the mistakes I make.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.630
- [Mark] Do you sometimes find
guys that want to pick you

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:53.100
up and you're afraid to
get in the car with them?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:56.220
- Yes, actually I was in Bakersfield

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.230
and that happened to me.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:01.430
And I was still walking and
the guy ended up parking

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:04.630
and getting out and running up on me

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.833
and tackling me and all kinds of stuff.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.230
It was so crazy

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:12.610
and my friend was on the
phone right down the street,

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:13.703
I was so mad.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:19.980
- [Mark] With the child
on the way, do you think

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.940
that'll motivate you to maybe

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.320
get out of this line of work?

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.180
- [Faith] It's already motivating me.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.243
- [Mark] Good for you.

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.380
That's nice to hear.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.243
All right, Faith.

00:15:33.243 --> 00:15:34.660
Well, thank you so much
for talking with me.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.493
- Thank you.

00:15:35.493 --> 00:15:36.326
- [Mark] And I wish you and your baby,

00:15:36.326 --> 00:15:41.180
the best of luck and I hope
some of your plans come true.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.560
- [Faith] All of them will.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.143
- [Mark] thank you.

